  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e18-scene-12",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "帮荣思伦争取新剧选角  (Helping a Sidelined Star Win a Lead Role)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "kaiwen": "凯文"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Once the false-ad response is assigned, Xingzi asks about Bu Xiaogu's personal mission: helping a loyal sidelined actor revive his popularity after the travel show delay. Listen to their Mandarin brainstorming first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "那私事呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "私事就是关于荣思伦的事，咱们得帮荣先生刷一刷人气了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这确实是个问题，荣思伦之前一直被东海经纪雪藏。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "虽然现在解除了，可是演员经纪这一块给到的资源不是很多。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "而且这次魅力远航的延播，对他的人气也是个打击。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "可那都是经纪部的事，咱们能干吗呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们最近有没有听说，有部剧特别火，叫倾城公主？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "最近他们在选角，这可是备受瞩目的大制作。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "网上网友和粉丝都说，荣思伦特别适合这部剧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不如咱们总编室就帮着经纪部，帮一帮荣思伦。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "行，这件事交给我吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "喂，你好，这里是总编室。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "那私事呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And what about the personal matter?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "私事就是关于荣思伦的事，咱们得帮荣先生刷一刷人气了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The personal matter concerns Rong Silun; we ought to help Mr Rong boost his popularity.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这确实是个问题，荣思伦之前一直被东海经纪雪藏。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That really is an issue, since Rong Silun was previously shelved by his old agency.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "虽然现在解除了，可是演员经纪这一块给到的资源不是很多。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Although the freeze is lifted now, our actor management side still gives him very few resources.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "而且这次魅力远航的延播，对他的人气也是个打击。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Plus, the broadcast delay of Charming Voyage dealt another blow to his popularity.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "可那都是经纪部的事，咱们能干吗呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet all of that falls under talent management, so what can our office do?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们最近有没有听说，有部剧特别火，叫倾城公主？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Have you heard lately about a super popular drama project called Princess Qingcheng?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "最近他们在选角，这可是备受瞩目的大制作。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They are casting right now, and it is a hugely anticipated major production.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "网上网友和粉丝都说，荣思伦特别适合这部剧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Netizens and fans online all say Rong Silun is a perfect fit for this drama.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不如咱们总编室就帮着经纪部，帮一帮荣思伦。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why does our editorial office not lend talent management a hand and help Rong Silun out?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "行，这件事交给我吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, leave this one to me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "喂，你好，这里是总编室。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello, this is the chief editor office speaking.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "那私事呢？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "私事就是关于荣思伦的事，咱们得帮荣先生刷一刷人气了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
